tinacloud-project-update-site-url(1) -- Manage TinaCloud project site URLs
==========================================================================

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud project update site-url` <command>

## DESCRIPTION

Add or remove site URLs for a TinaCloud project.

## COMMANDS

  * `add`:
    Register one or more site URLs.

  * `remove`:
    Remove one or more site URLs.

## EXAMPLES

Register a local development and production URL:

	$ tinacloud project update site-url add \
		--url http://localhost:3000 \
		--url https://example.com

Remove a retired site URL:

	$ tinacloud project update site-url remove --url https://old.example.com

